    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This substantial four-bedroom home enjoys a peaceful rural setting with lovely countryside views extending towards Dunmanus Bay. Set on a generous c.1.46-acre plot in Arderawinny, approximately 6km west of Schull village, the property offers excellent privacy while remaining within easy reach of the coast and the many attractions of this part of West Cork.\r\n\r\nThe generous gardens provide plenty of scope for landscaping, growing your own produce or simply enjoying the outdoors. The house also offers an exciting opportunity for the new owners to modernise and personalise both inside and out, creating a home to suit their own style and needs.\r\n\r\nA peaceful country setting, generous grounds and close proximity to Schull and the spectacular West Cork coastline make this an appealing property with plenty of potential.\r\n\r\nAll information is provided in good faith and believed to be correct; however, it is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No representations or warranties, express or implied, are made as to the accuracy, completeness, condition, or planning status of the property.\r\nInterested parties should investigate independently as to the accuracy of all details, including measurements, boundaries, area, BER rating, and available services. In addition, all apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services should be thoroughly tested to assess their working condition.\r\nPhotographs and videos are for guidance purposes only and may show items (such as furniture) that are not included in the sale unless specifically agreed between the parties."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Tenure: Freehold\r\n\r\nBER: C\r\nGROUND FLOOR\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALLWAY\r\n\r\nApproximately 4.1m × 2.7m\r\n\r\n13\\'5\\\" × 8\\'10\\\"\r\n\r\nThe entrance hallway provides access to the principal ground-floor rooms and features a traditional timber staircase leading to the first floor.\r\n\r\nUTILITY ROOM\r\n\r\nApproximately 3.4m × 3.3m\r\n\r\n11\\'2\\\" × 10\\'10\\\"\r\n\r\nThe practical utility room includes laundry facilities, fitted storage, worktop space and access to the rear entrance area.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN\r\n\r\nApproximately 4.2m × 6.3m\r\n\r\n13\\'9\\\" × 20\\'8\\\"\r\n\r\nThe generously proportioned kitchen features extensive timber cabinetry, plentiful work surfaces, integrated cooking facilities and windows overlooking the surrounding countryside.\r\n\r\nDINING ROOM\r\n\r\nThe separate dining room provides a welcoming family space with a feature fireplace, timber ceiling and glazed doors opening directly onto the garden.\r\n\r\nFRONT RECEPTION ROOM\r\n\r\nApproximately 5.5m × 4.2m\r\n\r\n18\\'1\\\" × 13\\'9\\\"\r\n\r\nThe spacious front reception room features a striking period-style fireplace, timber ceiling, multiple windows and glazed doors opening onto the garden.\r\n\r\nOFFICE/BONUS ROOM\r\n\r\nApproximately 3.0m × 4.2m\r\n\r\n9\\'10\\\" × 13\\'9\\\"\r\n\r\nThis flexible ground-floor room is suitable for use as a home office, study, playroom, hobby room or general-purpose bonus room.\r\n\r\nGROUND-FLOOR BATHROOM\r\n\r\nApproximately 3.5m × 1.2m\r\n\r\n11\\'6\\\" × 3\\'11\\\"\r\n\r\nThe ground-floor bathroom includes a bath, wash-hand basin and toilet.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nUPSTAIRS HALLWAY\r\n\r\nApproximately 2.7m × 5.6m\r\n\r\n8\\'10\\\" × 18\\'4\\\"\r\n\r\nThe spacious first-floor hallway provides access to all four bedrooms, the main bathroom and the hot press.\r\n\r\nFRONT LEFT BEDROOM\r\n\r\nApproximately 4.5m × 3.0m\r\n\r\n14\\'9\\\" × 9\\'10\\\"\r\n\r\nA bright and generously proportioned bedroom with attractive views of the surrounding countryside.\r\n\r\nBACK LEFT BEDROOM\r\n\r\nApproximately 3.1m × 4.2m\r\n\r\n10\\'2\\\" × 13\\'9\\\"\r\n\r\nA comfortable double bedroom offering generous floor space and natural light.\r\n\r\nBACK RIGHT BEDROOM\r\n\r\nApproximately 4.1m × 4.2m\r\n\r\n13\\'5\\\" × 13\\'9\\\"\r\n\r\nA generously sized bedroom benefiting from its own private en-suite shower room.\r\n\r\nBACK RIGHT EN-SUITE\r\n\r\nApproximately 1.2m × 1.9m\r\n\r\n3\\'11\\\" × 6\\'3\\\"\r\n\r\nThe en-suite includes a shower, wash-hand basin and toilet.\r\n\r\nFRONT RIGHT BEDROOM\r\n\r\nApproximately 4.2m × 3.0m\r\n\r\n13\\'9\\\" × 9\\'10\\\"\r\n\r\nA bright double bedroom with its own private en-suite shower room.\r\n\r\nFRONT RIGHT EN-SUITE\r\n\r\nApproximately 1.2m × 2.1m\r\n\r\n3\\'11\\\" × 6\\'11\\\"\r\n\r\nThe en-suite includes a shower, wash-hand basin and toilet.\r\n\r\nFIRST-FLOOR BATHROOM\r\n\r\nApproximately 2.8m × 2.8m\r\n\r\n9\\'2\\\" × 9\\'2\\\"\r\n\r\nThe main first-floor bathroom provides additional bathroom facilities for the remaining bedrooms.\r\n\r\nHOT PRESS\r\n\r\nApproximately 2.8m × 1.0m\r\n\r\n9\\'2\\\" × 3\\'3\\\"\r\n\r\nThe hot press provides useful storage space on the first floor.\r\n\r\nTOTAL FLOOR AREA\r\n\r\nApproximately 195.96 square metres\r\nBER No.: 112302179\r\n\r\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 177.20 kWh/m²/yr\r\n\r\nMain Energy Carrier: Heating oil"
